          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimaazi olwatuuka ati, yaakoba kyabazinga mu mamiro ag'amaani ati: “Byonabyona biri miraala.” Bwe yamala yaakubira kyabazinga amakiryaivu era yaakutama n'ekyeni kyatuuka ku itaka. Yaakoba ati: “Musengwa Katonda wo asaakibwe, akughaire okughangula abantu abaakudheemera iwe Isebantu kyabazinga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga yaamubuuza ati: “Omwisuka Abusalomu ali bukalamu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahimaazi yairamu ati: “Yoabu bw'antumye nze omugheereza wo, mboine nga ghaligho akasasamalo ak'amaani aye nga tiidhi kye kaviireku.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga yaamukoba ati: “Ira eruuyi eno oyemerere eno.” Ahimaazi yaira eyo yaayemerera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Omukushi yaatuuka yaakoba ati: “Isebantu kyabazinga, nkuleeteire amawulire amalungi. Olwaleero luno Musengwa Katonda akughaire okughangula abantu abaakudheemera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyabazinga yaamubuuza Omukushi ati: “Omwisuka Abusalomu ali bukalamu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukushi yaamwiramu ati: “Wo musengwa wange kyabazinga, ekyo ekituuse ku mwisuka oyo kigwananga kyatuuka ku bazigu bo, ni ku abo boonaboona abakudheemera ni bakukola akabi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho kyabazinga enaku yaamugema ey'amaani. Yaaja ghaigulu mu kimante ekyali ku mulyango ogw'ekibuga, yaalira amaziga. Yaaja nga bw'alira ati: “Woowe omwana wange Abusalomu, omwana wange, omwana wange Abusalomu. Nze nandifiire mu kifo kyo. Woowe Abusalomu omwana wange, omwana wange!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.18.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
